&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Bitpanda, we know that amazing customer service builds trust and lasting connections. As a Customer Support Associate, you’ll be the go-to person our users turn to — answering questions, solving problems, and making sure they always feel supported.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is the perfect way to kickstart your career in fintech if you’re fresh out of uni or just starting your journey. You’ll get hands-on experience in a fast-moving, international environment, learn directly from an experienced team, and grow your skills from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every conversation you have will help shape how people experience Bitpanda — and help you grow into the next stage of your career. 🚀&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the first point of contact for our users via live chat and tickets — always keeping your communication clear, friendly, and fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers solve everyday issues and make their Bitpanda journey smooth, positive, and stress-free.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share feedback and ideas with the team to improve the way we support our users and make the customer journey even better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work towards team goals like fast response times and high customer satisfaction while staying up to date with Bitpanda’s products and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be flexible with a shift-based schedule (including evenings and weekends) — planned in advance so you can balance work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an &lt;strong&gt;empathetic and friendly communicator&lt;/strong&gt; who enjoys helping people and can stay calm, reliable, and positive even when things get busy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You speak &lt;strong&gt;fluent English &lt;/strong&gt;and another EU language is an advantage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about &lt;strong&gt;fintech, investing, or crypto&lt;/strong&gt; and excited to learn more (bonus points if you already know your way around crypto wallets, DEXs, or trading).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re detail-oriented, dependable, and comfortable juggling multiple chats at once while still delivering &lt;strong&gt;clear, high-quality answers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced, international environment&lt;/strong&gt; and love working as part of a team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of an &lt;strong&gt;ambitious, fast-growing fintech&lt;/strong&gt; company, working alongside passionate people who love what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in shaping the &lt;strong&gt;customer experience at Bitpanda&lt;/strong&gt; and directly influence user satisfaction and loyalty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get real exposure to the world of &lt;strong&gt;investing, crypto, and financial services&lt;/strong&gt;, no prior expertise required, just curiosity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy plenty of &lt;strong&gt;career growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;, training, and the chance to move across teams as you grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a &lt;strong&gt;supportive, international team culture&lt;/strong&gt; where your ideas and feedback matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
