&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Intelligence Analyst at Bitpanda, you’ll foster data driven decision-making by helping product, engineering, operations, finance and so many more teams collect, analyse and understand key metrics that drive growth that impacts millions of end users globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and collaborate with Finance, Product and Operations to identify reporting needs and potential improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable analysts across the whole organisation and streamline dashboard creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the ongoing design of our self service BI visualisation platform and core data model to support advanced analytics and business intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unify business intelligence, data engineering and business stakeholders to build out data sets and models relevant to their core businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high data quality of the core data layer with dbt models with SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BI Tools (Metabase, Tableau or similar), SQL, Git, dbt and Python is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to work, learn and grow across teams and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with data-modelling (dimensional modelling, OBT or star/snowflake schemas), data quality frameworks and data visualisation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3 years of professional business intelligence experience or analytics engineering or data analyst with a passion for Crypto and FinTech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, business informatics, applied mathematics and statistics or similar is preferred and Master’s degree is a nice to have.&lt;/li&gt;
